### Create Evaluation — full example (bodyComposition + measurements + dietaryHabits)
# @name createEvaluation
POST {{baseUrl}}/persons/{{personId}}/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trainerId": "{{trainerId}}",
  "evaluationDate": "2024-09-04",
  "objective": "Reducción de grasa corporal",
  "trainingLevel": "intermediate",
  "bodyComposition": {
    "weightKg": 72.5,
    "heightM": 1.65,
    "bmi": 26.6,
    "bodyFatPercentage": 28.0,
    "muscleMassPercentage": 34.0,
    "boneMassKg": 2.8,
    "visceralFat": 8
  },
  "measurements": [
    { "measurementTypeId": "{{measurementTypeId}}", "value": 32.5 }
  ],
  "dietaryHabits": {
    "description": "Dieta alta en proteína, baja en carbohidratos. Come 4 veces al día."
  }
}

###

### Create Evaluation — minimal (bodyComposition only, no trainer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/persons/{{personId}}/evaluations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "evaluationDate": "2024-10-01",
  "bodyComposition": {
    "weightKg": 70.0,
    "heightM": 1.65
  },
  "measurements": []
}

###

### List Evaluations for a Person
GET {{baseUrl}}/persons/{{personId}}/evaluations

###

### Get Evaluation by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/evaluations/{{evaluationId}}
